export anchor GraphiteNeutralStyle:
    number: 224
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Graphite neutral
    idea: The baseline professional dark, with balanced mid-dark graphite greys in three steps, quiet borders and one soft blue accent, so nothing but the work and the statuses draws the eye.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #1b1d21, the page background and the style sheet
        surface: #24272c, the sidebar, cards and the search field
        raised: #2d3137, hover rows, secondary buttons and status chips
        line: #3a3f47, every border, divider and meter track
        ink: #e7e9ec, text
        muted: #a4abb6, labels, meta and axis text
        accent: #8ab4f8, the primary button, meters, this week bars and focus
        onAccent: #0f1f3d, text on the accent
        accentSoft: #2b3546, the current nav item
        accentText: #b3cdfb, links and the current nav label
        lastWeek: #7b8494, last week bars
        ok: #7dd3a0, On track text and icon
        risk: #f0c36b, At risk text and icon
        bad: #f59b93, Behind and overdue text and icon
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 14px at 1.5. The greeting is 24px at 650, KPI figures
        26px at 650 with tabular numbers, card titles 14px at 650, meta and
        table headers 12px, and status chips 12px at 600.
    layout:
        A classic app frame. A 224px graphite sidebar holds a blue square B
        mark with the name, then six nav links with line icons, Home filled
        with the soft blue tile. The main column starts with a top bar
        ruled below, holding search on the left and New project, a square
        bell with a red dot and Mara Okafor on the right. Then the greeting
        Good morning, Mara over the date and a red clock line reading 4
        tasks are overdue. Four equal KPI cards follow, the overdue figure
        red with a clock. Below, a wide Projects card holds a table with
        columns for project and category, a status chip, a thin blue meter
        with percent, tasks done and due date. A narrower right column
        stacks the Tasks completed card with paired weekly bars and a
        legend with totals, then Recent activity with initials discs.
        Below 1100px the right column moves under the table. Below 760px
        the sidebar becomes a row of icons, KPIs go two by two and table
        rows become stacked blocks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px card padding, 12px gaps between cards and KPIs, 28px page gutter.
    density: Medium. A full table of six projects sits beside the chart and the feed.
    corners: 8px cards, 6px buttons, fields and nav items, round chips and avatars.
    borders: 1px #3a3f47 on every card, row and field. Surfaces step up in lightness instead of using heavy lines.
    shadows: A faint 0 1px 2px black at 30 percent under cards only.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.75 stroke, 18px. Status uses a check circle
        for On track, a warning triangle for At risk and a crossed square
        for Behind, always beside the word inside a round chip. Overdue
        uses a clock.
    focus: A 2px soft blue outline offset 2px on every control, and around the whole search field.
    tone: Plain and neutral, such as Projects, Tasks completed, Recent activity and View all.
